          "code": "def robot_behavior(robot_state, world_state):\n    '''机械臂 arm_1 的行为函数，严格按调度时间窗执行'''\n    elapsed = robot_state.last_time\n\n    # 操作 op_7 [149, 231]，工位 loc_7，工件 wp_2\n    if elapsed < 149:\n        wait(149 - elapsed)\n    move(\"loc_7\", 0.0)\n    operate(\"task_execution\", \"wp_2\", \"loc_7\")\n    # 对齐结束时间\n    elapsed = robot_state.last_time\n    if elapsed < 231:\n        wait(231 - elapsed)\n\n    # 操作 op_5 [231, 298]，工位 loc_5，工件 wp_1\n    elapsed = robot_state.last_time\n    if elapsed < 231:\n        wait(231 - elapsed)\n    move(\"loc_5\", 0.0)\n    operate(\"task_execution\", \"wp_1\", \"loc_5\")\n    elapsed = robot_state.last_time\n    if elapsed < 298:\n        wait(298 - elapsed)\n\n    # 操作 op_4 [298, 367]，工位 loc_4，工件 wp_1\n    elapsed = robot_state.last_time\n    if elapsed < 298:\n        wait(298 - elapsed)\n    move(\"loc_4\", 0.0)\n    operate(\"task_execution\", \"wp_1\", \"loc_4\")\n    elapsed = robot_state.last_time\n    if elapsed < 367:\n        wait(367 - elapsed)",
          "explanation": "该代码为机械臂 arm_1 生成，严格遵循调度时间窗。每个操作开始前先 wait 到 start_time，然后瞬间移动到目标工位（move duration=0.0），执行 operate，最后 wait 到 end_time 确保时间对齐。由于调度时间窗连续且移动时间假设为0，代码能够避免资源冲突。"
